1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:07,000



2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000



3
00:02:40,208 --> 00:02:43,542
A forest in spring,
is like a mother's womb,

4
00:02:45,250 --> 00:02:47,542
in which thousands of little hearts beat.

5
00:02:49,875 --> 00:02:54,000
No matter how small,
life is the greatest of mysteries.

6
00:02:56,083 --> 00:03:01,000
And to get to the heart of the secret,
you sometimes have to listen carefully.

7
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:08,833
That little beating heart is Bambi's.

8
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:54,208
The birth of a little prince
is a magical event,

9
00:04:57,500 --> 00:05:00,708
especially for a curious crow.

10
00:05:20,125 --> 00:05:23,917
On the first morning of his life,
Bambi can already walk.

11
00:05:27,208 --> 00:05:30,458
That's instinct,
it comes from his ancestors,

12
00:05:33,958 --> 00:05:38,167
Like a little voice that will accompany
him in the face of all dangers.

13
00:05:41,917 --> 00:05:43,958
And there will be plenty!

14
00:05:56,375 --> 00:06:00,708
But in the early days,
nothing can replace a mother's care.

15
00:07:26,708 --> 00:07:30,542
Bambi and his family are
the greatest animals in the whole forest.

16
00:07:32,833 --> 00:07:37,292
And Bambi's little inner voice tells him
that danger sometimes comes

17
00:07:37,917 --> 00:07:40,125
from someone smaller than himself.

18
00:07:44,333 --> 00:07:46,917
Bambi has so much to learn.

19
00:09:35,667 --> 00:09:38,250
Rain mixes nature's scents.

20
00:09:39,333 --> 00:09:43,542
A firework of scents that makes
your sense of smell sparkle.

21
00:09:45,167 --> 00:09:49,875
One day, just by the smell of it,
Bambi will be able to sense the danger.

22
00:09:59,625 --> 00:10:03,125
For the time being, he can count
on his mother's protection

23
00:10:08,792 --> 00:10:12,708
and on a guardian angel ready
to get wet for him.

24
00:10:34,167 --> 00:10:38,500
Under the green roof,
Bambi is out of sight.

25
00:10:44,417 --> 00:10:48,167
The white dots on its back
mimic sun spots.

26
00:10:50,708 --> 00:10:52,417
A real camouflage.

27
00:11:00,500 --> 00:11:04,542
In the meadow,
there's nothing to protect them...

28
00:11:17,208 --> 00:11:19,917
Humans are the danger.

29
00:11:23,542 --> 00:11:27,958
And in the sun-gilded grass,
they could spot them!

30
00:11:29,625 --> 00:11:33,625
Bambi must never forget that
humans live beside the forest.

31
00:13:15,375 --> 00:13:20,000
It's worth taking a few risks
when wandering through the flowers.

32
00:13:22,375 --> 00:13:25,042
Freedom gives you wings.

33
00:15:57,958 --> 00:16:00,833
Eagles rarely venture into the forest.

34
00:16:02,042 --> 00:16:05,917
Bambi's little inner voice whispers
to him to hide,

35
00:16:06,417 --> 00:16:08,250
his instinct protects him.

36
00:16:12,917 --> 00:16:14,958
Bambi discovers fear.

37
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:18,917
But fear sometimes saves your life.

38
00:19:28,167 --> 00:19:30,583
If his mother sometimes disappears,

39
00:19:30,667 --> 00:19:34,375
it's because there's a lot Bambi
needs to understand by himself.

40
00:19:37,917 --> 00:19:40,750
It's the beginning of independence.

41
00:20:05,208 --> 00:20:07,667
Bambi is part of a large family

42
00:20:08,417 --> 00:20:11,333
and he'll have to find his place
among his own kind.

43
00:20:16,250 --> 00:20:20,000
He, too, will one day
have large antlers.

44
00:20:59,792 --> 00:21:03,167
Growing up means feeding yourself.

45
00:21:18,250 --> 00:21:21,000
Open your eyes and taste everything!

46
00:21:33,750 --> 00:21:36,625
And above all, to look at your mother.

47
00:21:38,125 --> 00:21:39,917
That's what learning is all about!

48
00:22:42,667 --> 00:22:46,792
Bambi discovers others
and their differences.

49
00:22:46,875 --> 00:22:50,208
Diversity is what makes
the world beautiful.

50
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:58,250
Nobody's the same.
And being curious isn't such a bad thing.

51
00:22:59,333 --> 00:23:02,500
Except maybe for a slightly
clingy raccoon.

52
00:26:14,500 --> 00:26:18,500
After a few weeks together, Bambi
is old enough to return to the group.

53
00:26:18,625 --> 00:26:21,250
And with a bit of luck,
meet someone new.

54
00:27:16,250 --> 00:27:17,667
Sometimes,

55
00:27:18,833 --> 00:27:24,250
the simple fact of looking
alike ignites a spark.

56
00:28:19,458 --> 00:28:25,042
When two little hearts get excited,
tenderness turns into adventure.

57
00:28:26,167 --> 00:28:30,708
And from adventure to recklessness,
the line is quickly crossed.

58
00:29:34,292 --> 00:29:37,750
Human shadows loom
over Bambi's happiness.

59
00:29:37,833 --> 00:29:40,667
They can appear
at any moment in the forest.

60
00:29:41,458 --> 00:29:45,000
But fortunately, someone is watching.

61
00:30:03,333 --> 00:30:08,708
Summer is well underway, a ball of fire
is shining above their heads

62
00:30:08,792 --> 00:30:11,083
and the shade would be some
kind of paradise

63
00:30:11,167 --> 00:30:13,500
if the insects would leave
them alone.

64
00:32:07,292 --> 00:32:09,167
The days go by,

65
00:32:09,250 --> 00:32:13,083
and while the carefree spirit of summer
brings joy to everyone's hearts,

66
00:32:13,167 --> 00:32:15,083
Bambi has to keep his guard up!

67
00:32:16,667 --> 00:32:20,042
But sometimes he dares to stray
away from his mother.

68
00:32:46,083 --> 00:32:51,000
Under a mother's protective gaze,
even the whims of the sky become a game.

69
00:33:16,042 --> 00:33:19,208
Nothing is sweeter than blossoming ties.

70
00:33:51,458 --> 00:33:53,875
Some nights are just magical.

71
00:33:57,208 --> 00:33:58,917
The little fairies are waking up.

72
00:34:13,458 --> 00:34:17,500
And now the fireflies think
they're stars falling from the sky.

73
00:34:43,958 --> 00:34:45,625
Like an owl's eyes in the night,

74
00:34:46,333 --> 00:34:48,917
a caring eye accompanies Bambi.

75
00:35:51,625 --> 00:35:57,125
In a small corner of the memory
hide the bad memories.

76
00:36:53,958 --> 00:36:58,000
Sharing each other's life experiences,
even the worst ones,

77
00:36:58,833 --> 00:37:02,458
is a good way to avoid the traps
set by humans.

78
00:39:25,792 --> 00:39:29,042
The wolf can be frightening.

79
00:39:31,083 --> 00:39:33,167
Yet it is the ancestor of dogs.

80
00:39:34,917 --> 00:39:36,458
Like a big prehistoric doggie!

81
00:39:55,167 --> 00:39:57,708
And then... like all forest animals,

82
00:40:00,750 --> 00:40:02,625
he eats what he likes.

83
00:40:05,083 --> 00:40:07,792
His meal is just a little more agitated.

84
00:42:10,667 --> 00:42:15,708
Ever since he was born, Bambi has been
reassured by his father's presence.

85
00:42:17,250 --> 00:42:22,750
When you're small, it's important to feel
secure in order to gain self-confidence.

86
00:42:23,792 --> 00:42:29,417
And Bambi will need
all the confidence he can get

87
00:42:29,875 --> 00:42:31,875
to become King of the Forest.

88
00:43:32,083 --> 00:43:34,125
Bambi is now six months old.

89
00:43:35,000 --> 00:43:37,375
Time has erased the stains
from the fawns' coats.

90
00:44:01,292 --> 00:44:05,792
A rumbling makes the whole forest
vibrate. It's the deer's bellow.

91
00:44:15,667 --> 00:44:17,375
For the first time,

92
00:44:17,458 --> 00:44:21,250
Bambi discovers that males have
an instinct to fight each other.

93
00:44:22,292 --> 00:44:26,917
His father and other males compete
for the favors of a doe.

94
00:44:33,750 --> 00:44:38,750
When he grows big and strong with antlers
on his head, he'll have to fight too.

95
00:45:01,917 --> 00:45:04,375
As he grows, Bambi changes.

96
00:45:05,375 --> 00:45:07,042
And with him, the forest.

97
00:45:26,208 --> 00:45:28,292
Even in the rain,
autumn ignites the colors.

98
00:45:32,042 --> 00:45:33,792
And Bambi's heart!

99
00:45:47,417 --> 00:45:50,875
But Bambi will discover that the season
of love comes to an end one day.

100
00:45:51,458 --> 00:45:53,292
There's a time for everything.

101
00:46:46,875 --> 00:46:52,583
Feeling the other person's distress,
powerless to do anything about it...

102
00:46:52,667 --> 00:46:56,917
When your inner voice is silent,
is it because you don't know what to do?

103
00:50:24,542 --> 00:50:28,125
Bambi's sense of smell has
become very powerful.

104
00:50:31,125 --> 00:50:34,542
Some smells are like ominous portents.

105
00:51:36,875 --> 00:51:39,792
A menacing presence
has burst into the forest.

106
00:51:41,833 --> 00:51:44,375
Bambi's mother knows about this threat.

107
00:54:27,375 --> 00:54:31,875
For Bambi, coping with his mother's
absence is a struggle.

108
00:54:35,208 --> 00:54:38,333
Sadness is coldness on the inside.

109
00:54:41,708 --> 00:54:44,167
And he doesn't know yet
that it's forever.

110
00:56:15,583 --> 00:56:20,625
His mother's lessons remain in his memory
and are a life force for Bambi.

111
00:56:28,083 --> 00:56:32,000
And fortunately, he's not alone.

112
00:59:06,417 --> 00:59:11,667
There are secret places in nature
that only a father's wisdom can reveal.

113
00:59:19,375 --> 00:59:22,542
Here magical remedies grow,

114
00:59:23,333 --> 00:59:27,333
plants that heal even the deepest wounds.

115
01:00:22,583 --> 01:00:27,625
The plants make his head spin
but they heal Bambi quickly.

116
01:01:42,333 --> 01:01:44,750
After a deer's antlers fall off,

117
01:01:44,833 --> 01:01:48,125
there's the happy promise that they'll
grow back even bigger the following year.

118
01:02:01,917 --> 01:02:06,458
There's nothing to stop
the wild boars having fun.

119
01:02:52,500 --> 01:02:56,083
When there are two of you,
it all seems lighter.

120
01:02:58,875 --> 01:03:02,208
Bambi forgets that the tiniest thing
could separate them.

121
01:03:03,917 --> 01:03:08,542
All it takes is one unexpected intruder
to scare Bambi's accomplice away.

122
01:04:07,167 --> 01:04:09,167
Bambi has plenty of strength within him.

123
01:04:15,083 --> 01:04:20,167
Alone again, his little voice tells him
not to lose hope.

124
01:05:23,625 --> 01:05:25,875
Life can be full of pitfalls.

125
01:05:27,042 --> 01:05:30,000
Every challenge we overcome
makes us grow...

126
01:05:32,958 --> 01:05:36,875
So much has happened to Bambi
in just one year in the woods!

127
01:06:41,833 --> 01:06:46,833
For deers and hinds,
there are no borders.

128
01:06:49,208 --> 01:06:51,792
They come and go as they please.

129
01:07:05,333 --> 01:07:09,042
Guided by his instincts,
more sure of himself,

130
01:07:09,417 --> 01:07:11,292
Bambi has only one idea in mind:

131
01:07:17,708 --> 01:07:20,292
find again the one he loves.

132
01:07:29,750 --> 01:07:33,333
And Bambi searches.
Searches again.

133
01:07:33,708 --> 01:07:35,250
Maybe comes closer?

134
01:07:57,625 --> 01:08:03,417
Humans are strange.
What a strange idea to lock up animals.

135
01:10:21,708 --> 01:10:25,750
To be free, to be together,
and swim in happiness.

136
01:10:26,917 --> 01:10:31,625
Returning to your land and your people.
There's nothing sweeter,

137
01:10:32,417 --> 01:10:35,250
except maybe love at first sight!

138
01:11:18,167 --> 01:11:21,042
Two carefree years spent together.

139
01:11:21,833 --> 01:11:24,000
When time passes peacefully,

140
01:11:24,458 --> 01:11:26,917
the little voices that warn
of dangers quieten down.

141
01:11:56,750 --> 01:12:02,792
Time has brought Bambi to a decision,
for his apprenticeship is not over.

142
01:12:08,208 --> 01:12:12,625
You have to leave with your father,
only to come back.

143
01:13:55,792 --> 01:14:01,167
Two more years have passed.
Bambi is four years old.

144
01:14:05,750 --> 01:14:10,792
Now, it's time for him
to become King of the Forest.

145
01:15:00,750 --> 01:15:03,833
Now it's his turn to look
after his little one.

146
01:15:05,958 --> 01:15:08,667
The story of Bambi can begin again.

147
01:15:11,083 --> 01:15:14,292
The one
of the little Prince of the forest.

148
01:15:40,208 --> 01:15:44,083
Subtitling:




